<view class="parallel-page">
  <view class="page-content">
      <view class="knowledge-card">
        <view class="card-heading">
          <text class="condition-index">1</text>
          <view class="card-heading-copy">
            <text class="card-title">线面平行</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <canvas
          id="linePlaneCanvas"
          type="2d"
          class="diagram-canvas"
          aria-label="平面外直线平行于平面内直线的示意"
        ></canvas>

        <view class="rule-box">
          <text class="rule-label">几何条件</text>
          <text class="rule-text">平面外的一条直线与平面内的一条直线平行，则该直线平行于此平面。</text>
          <text class="symbol-text">CD ⊂ P，AB ∥ CD，AB ⊄ P ⇒ AB ∥ P</text>
          <text class="projection-label">有积聚性投影时</text>
          <text class="projection-note">当平面为投影面的垂直面时，只要平面有积聚性的投影和直线的同面投影平行，或直线也为该投影面的垂线，则直线与平面必定平行。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="video-row">
          <button
            class="video-button"
            data-video-key="lineThroughPoint"
            bindtap="handleVideoTap"
            aria-label="播放视频号：过平面外一点作一直线平行于给定平面"
          >
            <text class="video-play">▶</text>
            <view class="video-copy">
              <text class="video-title">过平面外一点作一直线平行于给定平面</text>
              <text class="video-source">视频号讲解</text>
            </view>
            <text class="video-arrow">›</text>
          </button>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="knowledge-card">
        <view class="card-heading">
          <text class="condition-index second-index">2</text>
          <view class="card-heading-copy">
            <text class="card-title">面面平行</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <canvas
          id="planePlaneCanvas"
          type="2d"
          class="diagram-canvas"
          aria-label="两个平面内两组相交直线分别平行的示意"
        ></canvas>

        <view class="rule-box second-rule">
          <text class="rule-label">几何条件</text>
          <text class="rule-text">一个平面内的两条相交直线分别平行于另一个平面，则这两个平面平行。</text>
          <text class="symbol-text">AB ∥ EF，CD ∥ GH，AB ∩ CD ≠ ∅ ⇒ Q ∥ P</text>
          <text class="projection-label">有积聚性投影时</text>
          <text class="projection-note">若两投影面垂直面相互平行，则它们具有积聚性的那组投影必相互平行。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="video-row">
          <button
            class="video-button second-video"
            data-video-key="planeThroughPoint"
            bindtap="handleVideoTap"
            aria-label="播放视频号：过平面外一点作一平面平行于给定平面"
          >
            <text class="video-play">▶</text>
            <view class="video-copy">
              <text class="video-title">过平面外一点作一平面平行于给定平面</text>
              <text class="video-source">视频号讲解</text>
            </view>
            <text class="video-arrow">›</text>
          </button>
        </view>
      </view>
  </view>
</view>
